      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Belle Sorciere wrote:</b><br><blockquote>People seem to be anxious about the end of SotM, from commentary on this forum as well as elsewhere. I think what they're looking for is reassurance.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI think two things will strongly affect people's opinions:\n<ol>\n<li>How Spirit Island does in game stores.</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This, especially, I think. Neither GSF nor Sentinel Tactics has met with the same kind of overwhelming reception as SotM did.</p>",
